    {
      "name": "@mrzhaobh/dsh-plugin-sources",
      "title": {
        "en": "Plugins by source",
        "zh": "插件按来源分组"
      },
      "description": {
        "en": "Adds a By source tab to the Plugins page: installed plugins grouped by where they came from — which GitHub repository, the npm registry, a local directory, or shipped with DSH. Each group shows its count, all groups start expanded, and a group title collapses it (remembered locally). It only reads the Host's existing plugin list and changes no plugins.",
        "zh": "在 Plugins 页加一个「按来源」标签页：把已安装插件按来源仓库分组——GitHub 上的哪个仓库、npm registry、本地目录，还是 DSH 自带。每组显示数量，默认全部展开，点组标题可折叠（状态记在本机）。只读取 Host 已有的插件清单，不修改任何插件。"
      },
      "author": "MrZhaobh",
      "homepage": "https://github.com/MrZhaobh/dsh-plugins/tree/main/packages/dsh-plugin-sources",
      "repository": {
        "url": "https://github.com/MrZhaobh/dsh-plugins",
