    {
      "name": "@mrzhaobh/dsh-session-stars",
      "title": {
        "en": "Session stars",
        "zh": "会话星标"
      },
      "description": {
        "en": "Star sidebar sessions with one click: a star appears on the row while hovering, and starred rows keep a mark at the end. It only uses the row slots the built-in workspace plugin already declares, so it replaces nothing and usually survives a DSH upgrade. Stars live in browser localStorage under dsh.workspace.starred.v1.",
        "zh": "给侧栏会话一键加星：悬停时行尾出现 ☆，点一下变金色 ★ 并在行尾留下 🌟 标记。只占用内置会话区已经声明的行槽位，不替换任何内置插件，所以 DSH 升级通常不需要跟着改。星标状态存在浏览器本地（localStorage 的 dsh.workspace.starred.v1）。"
      },
      "author": "MrZhaobh",
      "homepage": "https://github.com/MrZhaobh/dsh-plugins/tree/main/packages/dsh-session-stars",
      "repository": {
        "url": "https://github.com/MrZhaobh/dsh-plugins",
