    {
      "name": "@mrzhaobh/dsh-sidebar-day-groups",
      "title": {
        "en": "Sidebar day groups",
        "zh": "侧栏按天分组"
      },
      "description": {
        "en": "Sections sidebar sessions under today, yesterday, and exact dates, each collapsible with a count, and pinned sessions get their own section. It is applied as four targeted edits to the installed workspace bundle rather than a full patch replay, aligned to DSH 0.2.2-rc.5; after a DSH upgrade run scripts/port-day-groups.mjs to realign.",
        "zh": "把侧栏会话按「今天 / 昨天 / 具体日期」分段，每段可折叠并显示条数，置顶会话单独成段。做法是在当前安装的会话区 bundle 上做四处定点移植（不是复制整包重打补丁），所以跟你的 DSH 版本对齐到 0.2.2-rc.5；DSH 升级后跑一次 scripts/port-day-groups.mjs 即可重新对齐。"
      },
      "author": "MrZhaobh",
      "homepage": "https://github.com/MrZhaobh/dsh-plugins/tree/main/packages/dsh-sidebar-day-groups",
      "repository": {
